---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { nextShow, isAccepting, feeLabel } from "../data/nextShow";
import type { SubmissionEnv } from "../server/env";
import { SITE_EMAIL } from "../consts";
export const prerender = false;
Astro.response.headers.set("Cache-Control", "no-store");
Astro.response.headers.set("Referrer-Policy", "no-referrer");
const show = nextShow;
const publishableKey = (Astro.locals.runtime.env as unknown as SubmissionEnv).PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY;
const accepting = isAccepting(show);
const fields = [
  { name: "name", label: "Your name (or group name)", required: true, max: 200 },
  { name: "email", label: "Contact email", required: true, max: 254, type: "email" },
  { name: "socials", label: "Any social handles for you or your projects?", max: 1000 },
  { name: "location", label: "Where are you based?", required: true, max: 200 },
];
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><BaseHead title={`Apply - ${show.subtitle}`} description="Apply to participate in Tootsie's Video Vault. Applying is free." /></head>
<body class="bg-neutral text-white"><Header /><main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
  <h1 class="text-center">Tootsie's Video Vault<br/>{show.subtitle}</h1>
  <p>We're looking for the funniest, weirdest, most rad filmmakers in the frickin' universe. Apply with examples of your work. If selected, you'll create something fresh for the show!</p>
  <p>Applying is free. Selected participants pay {feeLabel(show)} toward judges, the venue, prizes, and one comp to the show.</p>
  {accepting ? <>
    <dl><dt>Screening</dt><dd>{show.screeningAt} - {show.venue}</dd><dt>Application deadline</dt><dd>{show.deadline}</dd><dt>Notification Date</dt><dd>{show.notificationDate}</dd></dl>
    <p>{show.productionInstructions}</p>
  </> : <p class="notice">Applications are currently closed. Check back for the next show.</p>}
  <form id="application" data-show={show.id} data-open={String(accepting)} data-stripe-key={publishableKey}>
    <fieldset id="application-fields" disabled={!accepting}>
      {fields.map(field => <label>{field.label}{field.required && " *"}<input name={field.name} type={field.type || "text"} required={field.required} maxlength={field.max} /><span class="error" data-error={field.name}></span></label>)}
      <label>The screening is scheduled for {show.screeningAt} at {show.venue}. Can you attend the screening? *<select name="attendance" required><option value="">Choose an answer</option><option>Yes</option><option>No</option></select><span class="error" data-error="attendance"></span></label>
      <label>Have you been to Tootsie's before? We strongly encourage checking out a show to understand the vibe and effort people bring to their projects!*<select name="attendedBefore" required><option value="">Choose an answer</option><option>Yes</option><option>No</option></select><span class="error" data-error="attendedBefore"></span></label>
      <label>The magic of Tootsie's is that everybody is taking the time to create a new video from scratch. Do you understand that you'll be making a new 16:9 video under 3 minutes, not screening old material? People who underestimate the commitment and either dropout or slap something together the night before really bum us out!  <br/>If you feel you can make this commitment, type YESTOOTSIE. *<input name="newVideo" required maxlength="10" /><span class="error" data-error="newVideo"></span></label>
      <label>Links to portfolio or examples of past videos. Make sure to include any passwords if needed. *<textarea name="portfolio" required maxlength="5000" rows="4"></textarea><span class="error" data-error="portfolio"></span></label>
      <label>Anything else we should know?<textarea name="notes" maxlength="5000" rows="4"></textarea><span class="error" data-error="notes"></span></label>
      
      
      <label class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
    </fieldset>
    <section id="card-section" aria-labelledby="card-heading" hidden={!accepting}>
      <h4 id="card-heading">Submission Fee card commitment with Stripe</h4>
      <p>Applying is <b>FREE!</b> Only accepted submissions will be charged.  Save a card securely below with Stripe. No payment is collected now. Stripe handles your card details securely; your work samples and notes are stored separately.</p>
      <div id="card-element"></div>
      <p id="card-error" class="error" role="alert"></p>
    </section>
    <label class="consent"><input name="consent" type="checkbox" required /><span id="consent-text">I understand that if selected to participate in Tootsie's Video Vault, I authorize Tootsie's Video Vault to charge my saved card once for $25 USD. No fee will be charged if this application is not selected. *</span></label><span class="error" data-error="consent"></span>
    <p id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <button id="submit-button" type="submit" disabled>Save card and submit application</button>
    <button id="new-application" type="button" hidden>Start a separate application</button>
    <noscript><p>Please enable JavaScript to apply and securely save your card.</p></noscript>
    {accepting && !publishableKey && <p>Applications are not configured yet. Please contact us or check back later.</p>}
  </form>
  <p>Need help? <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`}>{SITE_EMAIL}</a></p>
</main><Footer />
<script src="../scripts/apply.ts"></script>
<style>
  main, main p, label, dt, dd { color: #ffffff; }
  main p, dl { margin: 1.25rem 0; } dt { font-weight: 700; } dd { margin: 0 0 .75rem; }
  label { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .4rem; margin: 1.25rem 0; font-weight: 600; }
  label span { font-weight: 400; } input, select, textarea { background: white; color: #004356; padding: .75rem; border: 2px solid #49cec8; border-radius: .4rem; width: 100%; }
  input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus, button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #efaa38; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .consent { flex-direction: row; align-items: start; } .consent input { width: 1.3rem; height: 1.3rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: .2rem; }
  button { background: #efaa38; color: #004356; border-radius: .4rem; padding: .9rem 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin: .5rem .5rem .5rem 0; cursor: pointer; }
  button:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; } fieldset:disabled input, fieldset:disabled select, fieldset:disabled textarea { opacity: .65; } .error { color: #ffcfaa; } .notice { border: 1px solid #49cec8; padding: 1rem; }
  .honeypot { position: absolute; left: -10000px; } [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  #card-element { background: white; padding: 1rem; border: 2px solid #49cec8; border-radius: .4rem; margin-top: .75rem; }
</style>
</body></html>
